Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,FANILO — Health for everyone, by voice, in Malagasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,No account. No name. Hanta, 16, simply asks her question in Malagasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:28.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,She gets an answer drawn only from messages approved by health professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:43.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,When a question needs a human, a counselor answers from the dashboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.53,0:00:56.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reply comes back in the app. Still anonymous. Still private.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:01:17.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lova, a community health worker, registers Voahirana. Consent comes first — even without network.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:37.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Her pregnancy is recorded. Antenatal visits and reminders are scheduled automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:57.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,During a visit, Lova reports a danger sign. One tap alerts the health centre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:02:12.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,A named person receives the alert, with a deadline and a backup — and acknowledges it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:30.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Health centres follow pregnancies, missed visits, alerts and referrals — anonymised data only.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:36.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,FANILO never diagnoses and never replaces a health worker.
